        <h3>Phonak (Switzerland)</h3>
        <p>A global pioneer in audiology for over 75 years. Renowned for pediatric excellence (Phonak Sky), high-power severe loss instruments (Naida UP), AutoSense OS AI sound processing, and Roger wireless microphone ecosystems.</p>
        <a href="/products?brand=Phonak" class="service-card-link">View Phonak Products &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Rexton -->
      <div class="service-card">
        <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">🇩🇪</div>
        <h3>Rexton (Germany)</h3>
        <p>Built with robust German engineering, Rexton hearing aids are celebrated for exceptional durability, moisture and sweat resistance, natural acoustic clarity, and high-performance rechargeable options.</p>
        <a href="/products?brand=Rexton" class="service-card-link">View Rexton Products &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Unitron -->
      <div class="service-card">
        <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">🇨🇦</div>
        <h3>Unitron (Canada)</h3>
        <p>Canadian acoustic engineering focused on natural conversations, comfortable listening environments, and intuitive smartphone companion apps designed to make hearing effortless.</p>
        <a href="/products?brand=Unitron" class="service-card-link">View Unitron Products &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Signia -->
      <div class="service-card">
        <div style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">🇩🇪</div>
